1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,100
Nu dansar vi loss! (Dansar loss!)

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,600
Hoppa, hoppa! (Hoppa, hoppa!)

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,000
